[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Flatpak App
Comment=A realistic Flatpak export. Note the trailing "@@u %U @@" file-forwarding
Comment[x-note]=block: the LAST token is not the app ID. IMPLEMENTATION.md section 10
Comment[x-note2]=explicitly forbids assuming it is. X-Flatpak is the reliable source.
Exec=/usr/bin/flatpak run --branch=stable --arch=x86_64 --command=example-app --file-forwarding org.example.FlatpakApp @@u %U @@
Icon=org.example.FlatpakApp
Terminal=false
X-Flatpak=org.example.FlatpakApp
X-Flatpak-Tags=proprietary;
